OL,3,ABBC launches partnership with Met      
OL,4,AOffice for weather coverage            
OL,6,FThe BBC has said it will offer more    
OL,7,Fregional, digital and 10-day weather   
OL,8,Fforecasts under a new partnership with 
OL,9,Fthe Met Office, which begins on        
OL,10,FThursday.                              
OL,12,FThe collaboration, announced last year,
OL,13,Faims to bring together the Met Office's
OL,14,Fweather and climate intelligence with  
OL,15,Fthe BBC's journalism and reach, the    
OL,16,Fbroadcaster said.                      
OL,18,FDirector general Matt Brittin said the 
OL,19,Fpartnership would mean "serving our    
OL,20,Faudiences with the most accurate,      
OL,21,Freliable and helpful weather service we
OL,22,Fcan".                                  
