OL,3,ABBC launches partnership with Met      
OL,4,AOffice for weather coverage            
OL,6,FBut the launch comes during a savings  
OL,7,Fdrive at the corporation, which has    
OL,8,Fseen some other weather services and   
OL,9,Fbulletins dropped as part of wider     
OL,10,Fcuts.                                  
